@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Staff
rectangle "Student Portal" {
  usecase "Search / filter courses" as Search
  usecase "View fees and intakes" as Fees
  usecase "Submit interest\n(optional message)" as Submit
  usecase "See confirmation and reference" as Confirm
  usecase "Sign in / sign out" as Login
  usecase "Manage courses" as Courses
  usecase "Manage events" as Events
  usecase "Search / filter / open inquiries" as Inquiries
  usecase "Update status and internal notes" as Notes
  usecase "View dashboard and reports" as Reports
  usecase "Export filtered CSV" as Export
}
Student -- Search
Student -- Fees
Student -- Submit
Student -- Confirm
Staff -- Login
Staff -- Courses
Staff -- Events
Staff -- Inquiries
Staff -- Notes
Staff -- Reports
Staff -- Export
note bottom of Staff
  Authenticated staff session required except for sign-in.
  No separate specialist staff roles in this build.
end note
@enduml
